---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { resolveAssetUrl } from "../utils/assets";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About the Cloud Administrator blog and Stanislav Zhelyazkov."
  canonicalUrl={Astro.url.toString()}
>
  <div class="page-header">
    <h1>About</h1>
  </div>

  <article class="prose">
    <h2>About the blog</h2>
    <p>
      This blog is about sharing knowledge related to IT and more specifically to Azure.
      It is also my personal hub for IT, Azure, and cloud information. I work with
      technologies like Azure, Azure Management and Security services, Azure Bicep, ARM Templates,
      and PowerShell.
    </p>

    <h2>About me</h2>
    <img
      src={resolveAssetUrl("/media/2012/03/stanislav_zhelyazkov2.jpg")}
      alt="Stanislav Zhelyazkov"
      class="about-portrait"
    />
    <p>
      I am a cloud Infrastructure Engineer at Accenture Netherlands and 13-time Microsoft MVP. My favorite
      technologies are Azure, Azure Management and Security services, Azure Bicep, PowerShell,
      System Center and Hyper-V. I strive to dive deep into them every day.
      My IT career started in 2007 as a Help Desk Specialist while studying Informatics at the University of Ruse.
      I also worked at HP Enterprise Services (now known as DXC), maintaining large corporate IT infrastructures for clients in the Netherlands, Switzerland, and Germany
      and I was involved in a private cloud project based on MS Hyper-V and System Center.
      I was also in the role of Principal Consultant at Lumagate, developing and consulting companies on Azure, Azure Monitor (formerly OMS), management, and private clouds.
      I am an active community member at Microsoft Q&A, StackOverflow, and ServerFault, providing answers on Azure, ARM and Bicep, Azure Monitor, Azure Policy, and other technologies.
    </p>

    <a href="https://mvp.microsoft.com/en-us/PublicProfile/5000120?fullName=Stanislav%20%20Zhelyazkov" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      <img
        src={resolveAssetUrl("/media/2012/03/mvp.png")}
        alt="Microsoft MVP"
        class="about-mvp"
      />
    </a>

